          "position": 1,
          "text": "Erhitze vegetable Öl in a Pfanne over mittlerer-hoher Erhitze und Pfanne-fry tofu cubes bis edges are golden, about 5 Minuten, then remove.",
          "timerMinutes": null,
          "ingredientKeys": [],
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "position": 2,
          "text": "In the same Pfanne, sauté sliced Zwiebel bis soft, about 2 Minuten.",
          "timerMinutes": null,
          "ingredientKeys": [],
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "position": 3,
          "text": "Gib dashi, soy Sauce, mirin, und Zucker to the Pfanne und bring to a köcheln.",
          "timerMinutes": null,
          "ingredientKeys": [],
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "position": 4,
          "text": "Return tofu to the Pfanne und köcheln together für 3-4 Minuten bis flavors meld.",
          "timerMinutes": null,
          "ingredientKeys": [],
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "position": 5,
          "text": "Divide cooked Reis between two bowls und top each mit tofu und Sauce, garnishing mit green onions und sesame seeds.",
          "timerMinutes": null,
          "ingredientKeys": [],
          "images": []
        }
